{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aMonster Slayer: Motion Edition\u300b<br>\ud83c\udfaf <strong>No VR headset needed!</strong> Just a standard webcam for motion-sensing action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff9 <strong>Revolutionary Motion Experience</strong><br>\u2022 Zero setup: Works with any laptop/desktop webcam (360p+) <br>\u2022 1:1 movement tracking: Arm swings = in-game attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three unique classes:</strong><br>\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Archer</strong>: Precise bow shots to snipe monsters<br>\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Shadow Ninja</strong>: Rapid shuriken combos<br>\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Elemental Mage</strong>: AoE fireballs &amp; whirlwinds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Progression System</strong><br>\u2022 Random loot chests with:<br>\u2705 <strong>Attack boosts</strong>: Fire/Multi-shot/Cyclone<br>\u2705 <strong>Defense buffs</strong>: Shields/Freeze/Lifesteal<br>\u2022 Auto-difficulty adjustment based on movement intensity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0b <strong>Dual Modes</strong><br><strong>Story Mode (12 levels)</strong><br>Fight through:<br>\ud83e\udd85 Storm Hawks \u2192 \ud83d\udd77\ufe0f Venom Queen \u2192 \ud83d\udc09 Ultimate Dragon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong><br>Infinite monster waves - <i>&quot;How long can you last?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 <strong>Tips</strong><br>\u2192 Single-player recommended<br>\u2192 2m\u00d72m play area + good lighting<br>\u2192 3-second gesture calibration</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"eat 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3887760/7f470f278d2a71c796b32fa791daccb525e6a680.jpg"},{"name":"eat200","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3887760/f20a518208cb4e12f80ec01074f4a485012617c7.jpg"},{"name":"eat2000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/ap